#: lock/autologout.cc:44
msgid "<qt><nobr><b>Automatic Log Out</b></nobr></qt>"
msgstr "<qt><nobr><b>Automaatsch afmellen</b></nobr></qt>"

#: lock/autologout.cc:45
msgid ""
"<qt>To prevent being logged out, resume using this session by moving the "
"mouse or pressing a key.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Wenn Du nich afmeldt warrn un dissen Törn wiederbruken wullt, beweeg de "
"Muus oder drück en Tast.</qt>"

#: lock/autologout.cc:50
msgid "Time Remaining:"
msgstr "Nablieven Tiet:"

#: lock/autologout.cc:86
#, kde-format
msgid "<qt><nobr>You will be automatically logged out in 1 second</nobr></qt>"
msgid_plural ""
"<qt><nobr>You will be automatically logged out in %1 seconds</nobr></qt>"
msgstr[0] "<qt><nobr>Du warrst in %1 Sekunn automaatsch afmeldt.</nobr></qt>"
msgstr[1] "<qt><nobr>Du warrst in %1 Sekunnen automaatsch afmeldt.</nobr></qt>"

#: lock/main.cc:61
msgid "KRunner Locker"
msgstr "KRunner-Slott"

#: lock/main.cc:61
msgid "Session Locker for KRunner"
msgstr "Törnslott för KRunner"

#: lock/main.cc:64
msgid "Force session locking"
msgstr "Afsluten vun Törns verdwingen"

#: lock/main.cc:65
msgid "Only start screen saver"
msgstr "Bloots Pausschirm anmaken"

#: lock/main.cc:66
msgid "Only use the blank screen saver"
msgstr "Bloots leddig Pausschirm bruken"

#: lock/main.cc:67
msgid "start with plasma unlocked for configuring"
msgstr "Mit opslaten Plasma starten, so dat sik dat instellen lett"

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:799
msgid "Will not lock the session, as unlocking would be impossible:\n"
msgstr "De Törn warrt nich afslaten, dat Opsluten is nich mööglich:\n"

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:803
msgid "Cannot start <i>kcheckpass</i>."
msgstr "<i>kcheckpass</i> lett sik nich opropen."

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:804
msgid "<i>kcheckpass</i> is unable to operate. Possibly it is not setuid root."
msgstr ""
"<i>kcheckpass</i> löppt nich. Villicht is dor nich SetUID \"root\" för "
"instellt."

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:866
msgid "No appropriate greeter plugin configured."
msgstr "Keen passen Grööt-Moduul fastleggt."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:98
msgid "<nobr><b>The session is locked</b></nobr><br />"
msgstr "<nobr><b>De Törn is afslaten</b></nobr><br />"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:99
#, kde-format
msgid "<nobr><b>The session was locked by %1</b></nobr><br />"
msgstr "<nobr><b>%1 hett den Törn afslaten</b></nobr><br />"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:112
msgid "Unl&ock"
msgstr "&Opsluten"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:114
msgid "Sw&itch User..."
msgstr "&Bruker wesseln..."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:182
msgid "<b>Unlocking failed</b>"
msgstr "<b>Opsluten is fehlslaan</b>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:190
msgid "<b>Warning: Caps Lock on</b>"
msgstr "<b>Wohrschoen: Grootschrievtast anmaakt</b>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:422
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cannot unlock the session because the authentication system failed to work;\n"
"you must kill krunner_lock (pid %1) manually."
msgstr ""
"De Törn lett sik nich opsluten, dat Systeem för de Identiteetprööv "
"funkscheneert nich;\n"
"Du muttst \"krunner_lock\" (Perzess-ID %1) vun Hand afscheten."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:511
msgid "&Start New Session"
msgstr "Nieg Törn &starten"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:519
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have chosen to open another desktop session instead of resuming the "
"current one.\n"
"The current session will be hidden and a new login screen will be "
"displayed.\n"
"An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually assigned to the first "
"session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can switch between "
"sessions by pressing Ctrl, Alt and the appropriate F-key at the same time. "
"Additionally, the KDE Panel and Desktop menus have actions for switching "
"between sessions."
msgstr ""
"Du wullt en anner Schriefdischtörn opmaken un den aktuellen nich "
"wiedermaken.\n"
"De aktuelle Törn warrt versteken un en nieg Anmellschirm wiest.\n"
"För elkeen Törn gifft dat en Funkschonentast; F%1 is normalerwies för den "
"eersten Törn, F%2 för den tweten usw. Mit Alt+Strg+[tohören Funkschoontast] "
"kannst Du de Törns wesseln, oder ok mit de Akschonen binnen dat KDE-Paneel "
"un de Schriefdischmenüs."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:532
msgid "&Do not ask again"
msgstr "Nich nochmaal &fragen"

